WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.709 --> 00:00:02.336
My Invisalign has--

00:00:02.419 --> 00:00:04.796
-I have taken out my Invisalign--
-I have taken out my Invisalign...

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:06.256
...and this is the album.

00:00:06.340 --> 00:00:08.008
(both laugh)

00:00:10.177 --> 00:00:12.262
["Bury A Friend" playing]

00:00:15.432 --> 00:00:16.266
[Billie] Good morning!

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:17.476
This is my parent's bed,

00:00:17.559 --> 00:00:20.062
and I sleep in here 
because I'm scared of monsters.

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:21.230
Today is a day to celebrate.

00:00:21.313 --> 00:00:24.816
[Billie] We made this album in a bedroom,
in our house that we grew up in,

00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:27.819
so, it's really like, anything is possible.

00:00:28.654 --> 00:00:32.241
[Billie’s Mom] I honestly don't know
how any artist of any age

00:00:32.324 --> 00:00:35.077
is doing it without a parent.

00:00:35.160 --> 00:00:36.370
(music ends)

00:00:36.453 --> 00:00:37.788
-Is that million?
-Yeah.

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:38.789
Oh, my God.

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:42.835
♪ Step on the glass, staple your tongue, ahh ♪

00:00:42.918 --> 00:00:44.753
♪ Bury a friend ♪

00:00:45.212 --> 00:00:47.256
♪ I wanna end me ♪

00:00:47.589 --> 00:00:48.715
Bad. Again.

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:49.633
♪ End me ♪

00:00:49.716 --> 00:00:51.009
Nope.
♪ I wanna, I wanna ♪

00:00:51.093 --> 00:00:52.803
♪ I wanna end me ♪

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:53.804
Boom.

00:00:53.887 --> 00:00:55.222
♪ I wanna end me ♪

00:00:56.056 --> 00:00:57.099
Ooh.

00:00:57.182 --> 00:01:00.394
  ♪ The debt I owe, gotta sell my soul ♪

00:01:00.477 --> 00:01:04.523
 ♪ 'Cause I can't say no, no, I can't say no  ♪

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:06.483
It sounds pretty horrible.

00:01:07.693 --> 00:01:09.236
