00:01:10.737 --> 00:01:12.239
["When the Party is Over" playing]

00:01:15.492 --> 00:01:17.995
[Billie’s Mom]
It is a horrible time to be a teenager.

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:19.413
  ♪ Quiet when I'm coming home ♪

