00:01:21.039 --> 00:01:23.041
  ♪ And I'm on my own ♪

00:01:23.125 --> 00:01:24.585
[Billie] I look into the crowd, and I see..

00:01:24.668 --> 00:01:27.754
every single person in there
is going through something...

00:01:27.838 --> 00:01:32.885
♪ I could lie, say I like it like that,
like it like that ♪

00:01:32.968 --> 00:01:35.220
...and I have the same problems.

00:01:35.304 --> 00:01:40.350
♪ I could lie, say I like it like that,
like it like that ♪

00:01:40.434 --> 00:01:44.563
I was like, "Why don't I turn this into art
instead of just living with it?"

00:01:44.646 --> 00:01:48.901
Hey, you guys need to be okay.
'Cause ya'll are the reason I'm okay. Okay?

00:01:48.984 --> 00:01:53.322
 ♪ Let me let you go ♪

00:01:53.405 --> 00:01:55.991
[Billie’s Dad] You have to have faith,
you have to do your best.

00:01:56.074 --> 00:01:57.743
Live your best life.

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.077
